### Variables de entorno
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api

### ====================================================================
### 0. AUTENTICACIÓN JWT (SimpleJWT)
### ====================================================================

### 0.1 Obtener Token de Acceso y Refresh (Login)
# (podes crear un usuaio con: uv run python src/manage.py createsuperuser)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "adminpassword123"
}

### Guardar el token devuelto en la variable para usarlo en las siguientes peticiones
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.access}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.refresh}}

### 0.2 Refrescar Token de Acceso
POST {{baseUrl}}/token/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh": "{{refreshToken}}"
}


### ====================================================================
### 1. DEMOSTRACIÓN DE SEGURIDAD Y PERMISOS (permission_classes)
### ====================================================================

### 1.1 Lectura pública permitida sin token (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ordenes/
Accept: application/json

### 1.2 Intento de creación sin token (Debe responder 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/clientes/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Cliente Sin Token",
  "telefono": "3510000000",
  "email": "sin.token@example.com"
}


### ====================================================================
### 2. CLIENTES (ModelViewSet)
### ====================================================================

### Listar Clientes (Lectura pública)
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes/
Accept: application/json

### Crear Cliente (Requiere Autenticación Bearer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/clientes/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Empresa Beta S.A.",
  "telefono": "3514001122",
  "email": "contacto@empresabeta.com"
}

### Ver Detalle de Cliente con órdenes anidadas (Lectura pública)
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes/1/
Accept: application/json

### Modificar Cliente (Requiere Autenticación Bearer)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/clientes/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Empresa Beta Modificada",
  "telefono": "3519999999",
  "email": "contacto@empresabeta.com"
}

### Eliminar Cliente (Requiere Autenticación Bearer)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/clientes/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ====================================================================
### 3. TÉCNICOS (ReadOnlyModelViewSet)
### ====================================================================

### Listar Técnicos (Lectura permitida)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tecnicos/
Accept: application/json

### Ver Detalle de Técnico (Lectura permitida)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tecnicos/1/
Accept: application/json

### Intento de Crear Técnico (Debe responder 405 Method Not Allowed porque es ReadOnlyModelViewSet)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tecnicos/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan Instalador",
  "categoria": "INSTALACIONES",
  "activo": true
}


### ====================================================================
### 4. ÓRDENES (ModelViewSet con Serializers Anidados)
### ====================================================================

### Listar Órdenes (Incluye Cliente, Técnico y Detalles anidados)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ordenes/
Accept: application/json

### Crear Orden con Detalles Anidados (Requiere Autenticación Bearer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ordenes/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numeroOrden": 3001,
  "cliente_id": 1,
  "tecnico_id": 1,
  "direccion": "Av. General Paz",
  "altura": 820,
  "tarea": "Configuración de Servidor y Firewall",
  "descripcion": "Instalación en rack principal",
  "estado": "PENDIENTE",
  "detalles": [
    {
      "descripcion": "Servidor Dell PowerEdge",
      "cantidad": 1,
      "precio_unitario": "1500000.00"
    },
    {
      "descripcion": "Módulo SFP+ 10Gbps",
      "cantidad": 2,
      "precio_unitario": "45000.00"
    }
  ]
}

### Ver Detalle de Orden (ID 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ordenes/1/
Accept: application/json

### Actualizar Orden Completa (PUT con autenticación)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/ordenes/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numeroOrden": 3001,
  "cliente_id": 1,
  "tecnico_id": 1,
  "direccion": "Av. General Paz",
  "altura": 820,
  "tarea": "Servidor y Firewall Configurado y Operativo",
  "descripcion": "Entrega y puesta en marcha realizada",
  "estado": "COMPLETADA",
  "detalles": [
    {
      "descripcion": "Servidor Dell PowerEdge",
      "cantidad": 1,
      "precio_unitario": "1500000.00"
    }
  ]
}

### Actualización Parcial de Estado (PATCH con autenticación)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/ordenes/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estado": "EN_PROCESO"
}

### Eliminar Orden (DELETE con autenticación)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/ordenes/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ====================================================================
### 5. DETALLES DE ÓRDENES (ModelViewSet)
### ====================================================================

### Listar todos los detalles de órdenes
GET {{baseUrl}}/detalles/
Accept: application/json

### Crear un detalle individual asignado a una orden existente
POST {{baseUrl}}/detalles/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orden": 1,
  "descripcion": "Cable de poder interlock",
  "cantidad": 2,
  "precio_unitario": "8500.00"
}

### Eliminar Detalle individual
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/detalles/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
